      }
    },
    "Send a photo within 48 hours of delivery and we'll replace it on the next run at no cost. Leaves sometimes bruise in transit — most plants recover within a fortnight, and we'd rather advise than replace unnecessarily." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "km" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
